"2026-11-10T18:30",
{
"draft": false,
"autoPublish": true,
"text": "A parent ran for school board on the platform of getting me fired. I was 26, a band director. He wanted my help going over the administration's head. I said no. What saved me: my band parents, my kids, and a community that knew who he was. Ever paid a price for saying no?",
"firstCommentText": "",
"media": [
"https://www.drrobfurman.com/social/2026-11-02/cruise-1.jpg"
