"2026-11-11T18:30",
{
"draft": false,
"autoPublish": true,
"text": "Before I was a principal, I was a high school band director. Picture 100 teenagers, each holding a noise maker, and your job is to make music. That room taught me more about teaching than any class I ever took. Former band kids: what did your director get right?",
